{"created": "2026-11-05T18:13:34.335941+00:00", "modified": "2026-11-05T18:13:34.717552+00:00", "id": 23986580, "conceptrecid": "22945021", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23986580", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22945021", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23986580", "metadata": {"title": "La Livr\u00e9e d'Herm\u00e8s \u2014 Progress report, September 2026", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23986580", "publication_date": "2026-11-05", "description": "<p class=\"FirstParagraph\"><span>Progress report on the mathematical study of La Livr&eacute;e d&rsquo;Herm&egrave;s, as of 5 November 2026.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\"><span>It contains: - the coordinated report of 31 October 2026, in French with an English summary; - an addendum of 5 November in both languages; - the current versions of the articles; - the latest results, including the supplement C1&ndash;C6 and the audit report of 5 November.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\"><span>The addendum summarises the new results: - exact spectral ambiguities at source orders 18 and 30; - the J-area law in gnomons; - the directional corpus of 379,920 patterns at order 30; - a conditional octet of 256 patterns with eight free binary choices. It also summarises their audit: the sixteen certificates reproduce, and independent programs confirm the octet, the isospectral pair, the J-area law and the count of 172 at order 18.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\"><span>Licence: CC BY 4.0.</span></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Amiot, Anibal Edelberto", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0002-6414-9448"}], "keywords": ["magic squares", "ansate cross", "half-shift criterion", "Jacquard weaving", "Chladni figures", "nodal lines", "cymatics", "frequency selective surfaces", "arithmogeometry", "parity figures", "level sets"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22722485", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-book", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22866061", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://github.com/anibaledel/livreedhermes", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "https://anibal-amiot.com", "relation": "isDescribedBy", "resource_type": "other", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22862110", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22967302", "relation": "isReferencedBy", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22965031", "relation": "documents", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22966838", "relation": "documents", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.22986529", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "2026.11.05", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/anibaledel/livreedhermes"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Report", "type": "publication", "subtype": "report"}, "alternate_identifiers": [{"identifier": "Q141191562"}], "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 3, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22945021"}}]}}, "title": "La Livr\u00e9e d'Herm\u00e8s \u2014 Progress report, September 2026", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23986580", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23986580", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23986580?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23986580", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23986580", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23986580", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23986580/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22945021", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22945021", "parent_doi": "https://doi.